@startuml
title CVE-2024-23897 - from a CLI argument to code execution
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EEF5FF
  BorderColor #335061
}
skinparam ArrowColor #335061
start
:Attacker sends a CLI command
with an argument "@/path/to/file";
:args4j expandAtFiles replaces
"@file" with the file's lines
(Jenkins <= 2.441, LTS <= 2.426.2);
if (Attacker has Overall/Read?) then (yes)
  :Attacker reads
  the whole file;
else (no)
  :Attacker reads the first
  lines only (3 in core);
endif
:Read secrets/ keys and config files
(binary keys partly readable);
if (Binary secrets recovered?) then (yes)
  :Forge a resource root URL,
  a remember-me cookie
  or a CSRF crumb;<<#EEF5FF>>
  :Script Console as an admin,
  which is remote code execution;
else (no)
  :Read any text file:
  config.xml, job files, users;
endif
:Fix: 2.442 / LTS 2.426.3 disables @file
(escape hatch hudson.cli.CLICommand.allowAtSyntax);
stop
@enduml
